 [#D7D7AF]'Phase 2: Non-fatal inventory classification and diagnostics' section: [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]make hood selection and eligible-hood discovery total, and surface every[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]skipped record as a diagnostic instead of aborting the build.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Per-item publication isolation, honest errors, and quarantine[/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]outbox-isolation[dim] · [dim][/dim]after inventory-tolerance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 3: Per-item publication isolation, honest errors, and quarantine'[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]section: stop head-of-line blocking in the outbox drain, record per-item[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]errors instead of broadcasting one error to every item, and quarantine [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repeatedly failing items.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Single-inventory drain and lock-time reduction[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]publication-performance[dim] · [dim][/dim]after inventory-tolerance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 4: Single-inventory drain and lock-time reduction' section: build[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the project inventory once per drain, deduplicate queued hoods, stop the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]permanently-stale name-registry rebuild, and reduce work done while [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]holding the sidecar lock.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prevent new non-terminal family-role names[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]name-generation-guard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after identity-tolerance[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 5: Prevent new non-terminal family-role names' section: stop [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]family attachment from generating names whose role suffix is not [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]terminal, so no new unclassifiable names enter the artifact store.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Backlog drain, link verification, and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]recovery-verification[dim] · [dim][/dim]after outbox-isolation, publication-performance,[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]name-generation-guard[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]'Phase 6: Backlog drain, link verification, and documentation' section: [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]drain the real stuck backlog, prove the first successful v2 publication,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify previously dead SASE_AGENT links resolve, and document outbox [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diagnostics and recovery.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-91","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-91.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-0f7cca2e64555c3870dd42a1cf7248e0","started_at":"2026-07-24T23:43:18.028340+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"1c24b77549e40950d123698c95fd8ffdb601d6fdabf4e9bc2a74c4c5c0136abc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-91.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"b69a28081257d785ee65a3f68f71674af7f25d13af1bcfcf63127bab793bdee9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-91.land/meta.json","size_bytes":580},"prompt":{"digest":"1e30330b2d7e381d23a2d8acfc1084b13d3d9c71a516da5db3807d08fd872c30","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-91.land/prompt.md","size_bytes":288},"state":{"digest":"cf5e42dddb79b288302b7686f34b108e636026cd4205666e84f1156b24aa871a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-91.land/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-91.land","local_name":"sase-91.land","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-91","agent_clan_generation":"20260724194301","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-91","changespec_name"